    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Rift </strong>- is a unique mix of <strong>RPG and RTS</strong> in a magical world where you will take on the role of a wizard serving the gods. Your decisions will determine the fate of this world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a wizard</strong> - learn powerful spells and use them in tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build an army</strong> - summon a variety of creatures that fight independently enough and don't require constant attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and strengthen</strong> - build magical structures that improve your abilities and give you strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for power</strong> - take part in challenges against other mages to gain new spells and replenish your army with new creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge of the gods and prove yourself worthy of their power?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Rift </strong>- is a unique mix of <strong>RPG and RTS</strong> in a magical world where you will take on the role of a wizard serving the gods. Your decisions will determine the fate of this world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a wizard</strong> - learn powerful spells and use them in tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build an army</strong> - summon a variety of creatures that fight independently enough and don't require constant attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and strengthen</strong> - build magical structures that improve your abilities and give you strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for power</strong> - take part in challenges against other mages to gain new spells and replenish your army with new creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge of the gods and prove yourself worthy of their power?</p>",
    "short_description": "Soul Rift is a mix of RPG and RTS in a magical world where you will take on the role of a wizard with an army of magical creatures. - Learn spells and use them in tactical battles. - Summon a variety of creatures. - Build magical structures that improve your abilities.",
